iPhone PC Transfer

This software is distributed under the MIT License. It uses third-party Python
packages governed by their respective licenses.

This application is intended for local network file transfer between a Windows PC
and mobile devices through a browser interface. It is not an Apple AirDrop
implementation and does not use Apple AirDrop, AWDL or proprietary Apple
protocols.

